      "writtenOn": "2024-12-16T16:17:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s not a problem, you can patch the camera libraries to use a different property or add the 2 lines to sync the two props to your init scripts. I agree that it\u0027s not worth the Soong complexity to let the name of the property be variable. A common name makes it consistent between devices.",
